        "pillar2_title": ".IA Namespace Sovereignty",
        "pillar2_body": "Mandate for the European Commission to exercise its external representation powers before ISO (Agency 3166) and ICANN/IANA in order to protect, reserve and assign the .IA domain as a strategic European asset, following the legal precedent of the .eu domain.",
